; Print a name with its article and "is"/"are", the id from the stack
;
; Message control code 19. The caller of the message printer pushed AF (A = id
; of the thing) before it, below one more word that the printer keeps; this
; takes the AF off the stack, leaves the other word in place and continues in
; #R$7428.
;
; (stack) Id of the thing in the A of a pushed AF, below the return address and one saved word
; O:DE Word code: "is" or "are" (see #R$7428)
; O:F NZ
@label=PrintNameIsFromStack
c$742D POP DE        ; return address
 $742E POP HL        ; the word the printer keeps
 $742F POP AF        ; A = id
 $7430 PUSH HL       ; put the kept word back
 $7431 PUSH DE       ; and the return address
 $7432 JR $7428      ;
